(Bug #73: the signature tables carry the return type as well as the
 parameters. A swallowed definition's `value` return had no entry either,
 so the caller could not know the tag rides home in r11 beside the payload.)

For each attempt from 1 to 2,
    If attempt is 99 then, Break.
To echo with a value called given.
    Return a value, given.

a value called returned is echo of "round trip".
Print "{returned's type}".
Print returned.
Exit 0.
